    "q-365878": {
      "dom_id": "step-q365878",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Consider the vector field $F(x,y,z)=⟨y,\\,z,\\,2x⟩$ and the surface $S$ defined in Cartesian coordinates as $z=2$ for $0\\le x\\le 3$ and $0\\le y\\le 2.$ Calculate the flux of $F$ through $S$ with respect to the upward-pointing unit normal vector $n.$",
      "worked_solution": "If $S$ is an oriented surface with unit normal vector $n,$ and $F$ is continuous vector field, then the flux of $F$ across $S$ measured with respect to $n$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S.\n$$\n\nFor the surface $z=2$ for $0\\le x\\le 3$ and $0\\le y\\le 2,$ the upward-pointing unit normal vector is\n\n$$\nn=⟨0,\\,0,\\,1⟩.\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $z=2$ on $S,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F\\cdot n & =⟨y,\\,z,\\,2x⟩\\cdot ⟨0,\\,0,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨y,\\,2,\\,2x⟩\\cdot ⟨0,\\,0,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can calculate the flux of $F$ across $S$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{S}2x\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}2x\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{3}2x\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\text{d}y{\\int }_{0}^{3}2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\cdot {[{x}^{2}]}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =18\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-365878-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "6",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"121\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-365878-b",
